docs {
  Whether an administrator has attested that a BAA is in place.

  This is a fail-closed DEPLOYMENT CONTROL that enforces a requirement. It is
  not the agreement, and it is not proof of HIPAA compliance. Unset or false
  blocks all PHI access, including /respond.
}
